      "Bạn navigate biography vs text question cho thesis defense. Cụm: 問題は、伝記をいかに用いるかであって、伝記を用いるか否かではない. KHÔNG flat reject biography (naive Barthean) hay flat accept (naive positivist) — articulate third position.",
